    "ordering": "library order reversed between scenarios; --reverse-order counterbalances a second run; trials within a level remain consecutive",
    "http_control": "optional 200 allowed requests, 10 clients, 1 trial per library over loopback TCP with uvicorn; client/server share one event loop; not a deployment model",
